haracters and the strange world they find themselves in (total playtime: 5-8 hours)! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175950/extras/d3a2eb8de04f5a26a7c4e0c01bc167a4.webp?t=1752183787\" width=11 height=11 /></span> <strong>Beautiful</strong> and unique artwork drawn by hand, all available to view in a dedicated gallery of memories! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175950/extras/d3a2eb8de04f5a26a7c4e0c01bc167a4.webp?t=1752183787\" width=11 height=11 /></span> <strong>Relax</strong> your mind to a melancholic soundtrack courtesy of professional musicians Crowander and Derek Clegg!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dedicated to the memory of Sven Johan Borgelind (1945-2022).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175950/extras/abda068d0269f2390b46bdf9a0da2470.webp?t=1752183787\" width=597 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175950/extras/807121a081fe487e12b462fd9b6637fc.avif?t=1752183787\" width=550 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175950/extras/bd4918828869ac6b52c6ffae9cc8be14.avif?t=1752183787\" width=550 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175950/extras/d8263b579742ba275c2584f0b51397d3.avif?t=1752183787\" width=550 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb